.TH config 1 0.2.13 https://github.com/dbowm91/cargo-cleanme "General Commands Manual"
.SH NAME
config \- Print, show, or edit the config file
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBconfig\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Print, show, or edit the config file
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
config\-path(1)
Print the path of the config file
.TP
config\-show(1)
Print the effective config
.TP
config\-edit(1)
Open the config in an editor (`$VISUAL`, then `$EDITOR`)
.TP
config\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
